B.a0A=new A.aN("FrostHub is a student app designed to provide seamless access to your academic schedule, group announcements, chats, and notes\u2014all powered by a custom backend without Firebase.\n\nKey Features:\n- Class timetable and reminders\n- Group announcements and chat\n- Notes and syllabus management\n\nThis app is developed by Sehaj Arora, a student at Thapar University (COPC branch). It aims to simplify university life by integrating all essential academic tools into one place.\n\nUnlike many apps, FrostHub does not use Firebase for backend services; instead, it uses a custom backend called FrostCore for more control and customization.\n\nThank you for using FrostHub!",null,B.YW,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
